  "problem": "Consider the following initial value problem for the functions $y=y(x),z=z(x):$\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}=\\frac{xy}{z}+1,\\, & y(-1)=-2 \\\\ {z}^{′}=x+yz-1,\\, & z(-1)=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse Euler's method with two steps of equal size to approximate $y(0)$ and $z(0).$\n\n$y(0)≈$\n{{field-1}},\n$\\,z(0)≈$\n{{field-2}}",
